        "\"\"\"\n",
        "simulate.py\n",
        "\n",
        "Run this file to:\n",
        "1. Simulate the population evolving over many generations\n",
        "2. Print the final equilibrium mix\n",
        "3. Save a plot showing how the strategy mix changed over time\n",
        "\n",
        "Usage:\n",
        "    python simulate.py\n",
